time="2026-11-03T11:17:51.195-05:00" level=info msg="Final message: \"In-Reply-To: <CABAFTuv9-fzjSAKf8LMQvEnbbrhc529e24Gd3ospkbmKMVP0XA@mail.gmail.com>\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nReferences: <28440220.15236.1711665155682@app130160.ycg201.service-now.com> <BL0PR07MB5617BEE1E0FFAB1C7DDC09E2B1692@BL0PR07MB5617.namprd07.prod.outlook.com> <CABAFTuu6=64O4EJknEwjd0BxoF_REuhmABeveOd_P1cSFMy5gA@mail.gmail.com> <CABAFTuv9-fzjSAKf8LMQvEnbbrhc529e24Gd3ospkbmKMVP0XA@mail.gmail.com>\\r\\nSubject: Re: Fwd: Fw: INC0649616 (Onsite:   that pc) has been commented\\r\\nTo: jason_wilson@hms.harvard.edu\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary=\\\"ec32a154f5364b0839390bc9af9f1df2a6d75bdf6c8759b806e3f863cdf6\\\"\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\n\\r\\n--ec32a154f5364b0839390bc9af9f1df2a6d75bdf6c8759b806e3f863cdf6\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nHi Jason,\\n\\nI'm not sure what you've changed, but I was double checking the config on my side, and tried ssh'ing in on a whim and it works now--so whatever the current configuration is now works! How are things looking on your end?\\n\\nOn Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:39:00 -0500, \\\"Lindgren, Caleb\\\" <clindgren@g.harvard.edu> said:\\n> Actually, I think that one was for a Windows Box that is also called Ardia. This machine is running Linux. But should be another ticket under Joao's name around that same time (early to mid 2024). Let me know if you want me to try and find more messages from Joao.\\n>\\n> On Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:35:04 -0500, \\\"Lindgren, Caleb\\\" <clindgren@g.harvard.edu> said:\\n>> Hi Jason,\\n>>\\n>> Joao forwarded me the messages below from the original installation. Looks\\n>> like it was  INC0649616\\n>> <https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__harvardmed.service-2Dnow.com_nav-5Fto.do-3Furi-3Dincident.do-253Fsys-5Fid-3D6ef9eb1f93e48214b772fe9a7bba1018-2526sysparm-5Fstack-3Dincident-5Flist.do-253Fsysparm-5Fquery-3Dactive-3Dtrue&d=DwMFaQ&c=WO-RGvef