ue, 3 Nov 2026 09:39:00 -0500, \\\"Lindgren, Caleb\\\"\\n> <clindgren@g.harvard.edu> said:\\n>> Actually, I think that one was for a Windows Box that is also called Ardia. This machine is running Linux. But should be another ticket under Joao's name around that same time (early to mid 2024). Let me know if you want me to try and find more messages from Joao.\\n>>\\n>> On Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:35:04 -0500, \\\"Lindgren, Caleb\\\" <clindgren@g.harvard.edu> said:\\n>>> Hi Jason,\\n>>>\\n>>> Joao forwarded me the messages below from the original installation. Looks\\n>>> like it was  INC0649616\\n>>> <https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__harvardmed.service-2Dnow.com_nav-5Fto.do-3Furi-3Dincident.do-253Fsys-5Fid-3D6ef9eb1f93e48214b772fe9a7bba1018-2526sysparm-5Fstack-3Dincident-5Flist.do-253Fsysparm-5Fquery-3Dactive-3Dtrue&d=DwMFaQ&c=WO-RGvefibhHBZq3fL85hQ&r=9-RHWsyl6lOUmPJop_8ltcRR-7I_PSffMa8QbIt4Fes&m=tc2wedwG0sjUB1CMhvackdqaTFgvsKqWOekAaPNHGHSXWQVYy07mf6os1gUip4-V&s=4YBfAlziSZjT6W3ra9phGfC73q5ZrvVrL-djbO2pQFw&e=>\\n>>>\\n>>> Thanks!\\n>>>\\n>>> Caleb\\n>>>\\n>>> ---------- Forwarded message ---------\\n>>> From: Paulo, Joao A <joao_paulo@hms.harvard.edu>\\n>>> Date: Tue, Nov 3, 2026 at 9:30\\u202fAM\\n>>> Subject: Fw: INC0649616 (Onsite: that pc) has been commented\\n>>> To: Lindgren, Caleb <clindgren@g.harvard.edu>\\n>>>\\n>>>\\n>>>\\n>>> ------------------------------\\n>>> *From:* Peter Cobb via STAT <servicenow@hms.harvard.edu>\\n>>> *Sent:* Thursday, March 28, 2024 6:32 PM\\n>>> *To:* Gygi, Steven P. <steven_gygi@hms.harvard.edu>; Minton, Zachary <\\n>>> zach@hms.harvard.edu>; Tanner, Adam <adam_tanner@hms.harvard.edu>; Paulo,\\n>>> Joao A <Joao_Paulo@hms.harvard.edu>\\n>>> *Subject:* Re: INC0649616 (Onsite: that pc) has been commented\\n>>>\\n>>>\\n>>> Reply from: peter_cobb@hms.harvard.edu\\n>>>\\n>>> Hi Guys,\\n>>>\\n>>> Crap, OK, I’ll stop by first thing tomorrow morning to get this sorted out\\n>>> and get these both back online.\\n>>>\\n>>> Peter