time="2026-11-04T14:51:13.919-05:00" level=info msg="Final message: \"MIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nSubject: Course registration advising hold\\r\\nTo: \\\"Gygi, Steven P.\\\" <steven_gygi@hms.harvard.edu>\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary=\\\"03ef3f8cb8ff21da9096644754ab0dda82904b57016e8b0c1dcd53337829\\\"\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\n\\r\\n--03ef3f8cb8ff21da9096644754ab0dda82904b57016e8b0c1dcd53337829\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nHi Steve,\\n\\nThey're making do Spring registration in November now, and I have an advising hold on my account that you need to clear before I can register. If you can clear that, I'd appreciate it.\\n\\nThanks,\\n\\nCaleb\\n\\r\\n--03ef3f8cb8ff21da9096644754ab0dda82904b57016e8b0c1dcd53337829--\\r\\n\"" pid=31988
