time="2026-11-05T10:46:24.328-05:00" level=info msg="Final message: \"In-Reply-To: <010001a1a9059084-a8379ea4-289d-4665-9704-832935a07f2b-000000@email.amazonses.com>\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nReferences: <010001a1a9059084-a8379ea4-289d-4665-9704-832935a07f2b-000000@email.amazonses.com>\\r\\nSubject: Fwd: PhD Posters order # 310698\\r\\nTo: \\\"Ritchie, Fiona\\\" <fiona_ritchie@hms.harvard.edu>\\r\\nContent-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary=\\\"accb72ff9622a90f0d7484c49ea5021a8934408de23ac962832992c744e7\\\"\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\n\\r\\n--accb72ff9622a90f0d7484c49ea5021a8934408de23ac962832992c744e7\\r\\nContent-Disposition: inline\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nHi Fiona,\\n\\nI used the Gygi lab card to print a poster yesterday. The receipt is below.\\n\\nThanks!\\n\\nCaleb\\n\\nOn Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:04:36 -0500, boston@phdposters.com said:\\n> Dear Caleb,\\n>\\n> This is an automatic message to let you know we've received your order.  If there's a problem or mistake, please contact boston@phdposters.com, but don't worry if you don't get an immediate response -- we work mostly in the evenings.\\n>\\n> If you need to make changes or upload a replacement file, use the link at the bottom of this email.  Otherwise, we'll email you with details when your poster is ready!\\n>\\n> Regards,\\n> The PhD Posters Team (boston@phdposters.com)\\n>\\n> -----\\n> PhD Posters order        #310698 (07:02 PM Wednesday, November 04, 2026)\\n> Placed by                Caleb Lindgren (clindgren@g.harvard.edu)\\n> Deliver via              Pick up on campus (Boston / The Longwood Collective at 375 Longwood Ave)\\n> Est. ship/pickup date    Thursday, November 05, 2026\\n>\\n> Confirmed payment of $105.99 USD\\n> Paid by Caleb Lindgren (clindgren@g.harvard.edu)\\n> Paid with mastercard ****2686\\n> Tax exemption #042103580 (Harvard)\\n>\\n> 1 print in this order:\\n>   poster_layout.pdf (pdf, 1889095 bytes) -- 60\\\" x 36\\\", paper ($70.99)\\n>\\n> *** RUSH ORDER ***\\n>\\n> Poster(s)             $   70.99 USD\\n> Delivery + handling   $   35.00 USD\\n> (including rush fee)\\n> Subtotal              $  105.99 USD\\n> Tax                   $    0.00 USD\\n> Total                 $  105.99 USD\\n>\\n> To make changes:\\n>   https://phdposters.com/myorder?o=310698&s=1db5847e5ee7fed4\\n>\\n> Special instructions:\\n> Evening phone: 971-808-0296\\n>\\n>\\n> Printable receipt:\\n>   https://phdposters.com/receipt/310698/1db5847e5ee7fed4\\n>\\n>\\r\\n--accb72ff9622a90f0d7484c49ea5021a8934408de23ac962832992c744e7--\\r\\n\"" pid=18616
