Franke Honors College\\n>> The University of Arizona\\n>>\\n>> ________________________________\\n>> From: Hirschmann, Maile <mailejim@g.harvard.edu>\\n>> Sent: Monday, November 2, 2026 12:59 PM\\n>> To: Caleb Lindgren <clindgren@g.harvard.edu>; Mount, Kaia Helen - (kmount) <kmount@arizona.edu>\\n>> Cc: Carlos Morales <carlosmorales@g.harvard.edu>\\n>> Subject: [EXT] Harvard SSQB application assistance program mentor-mentee matching\\n>>\\n>>\\n>> External Email\\n>>\\n>> ________________________________\\n>> Dear Kaia and Caleb,\\n>>\\n>> We have matched you as part of the SSQBio Application Assistance Program (AAP) for this application cycle! Attached here are the mentee guidelines. Mentors should have received their guidelines in a separate email. We recommend that mentees email their mentors separately from this email to begin your email exchanges. In this email, introduce yourself, describe what you would like to get out of the program, and establish what frequency you’d like to communicate with your mentor.\\n>>\\n>> Let us know if either of you have any questions now or later in the AAP mentoring process.\\n>>\\n>> Happy matching!\\n>> Maile and Carlos\\n>>\\n>> Mentee guidelines: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JLGIXbHLtGximivA8CN5HHYBChRnO5ABZWMaCWIdEJw/edit?tab=t.0<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JLGIXbHLtGximivA8CN5HHYBChRnO5ABZWMaCWIdEJw/edit?tab=t.0><https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JLGIXbHLtGximivA8CN5HHYBChRnO5ABZWMaCWIdEJw/edit?tab=t.0<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JLGIXbHLtGximivA8CN5HHYBChRnO5ABZWMaCWIdEJw/edit?tab=t.0>>\\n>>\\n>\\r\\n--5b221d15c03ee33ce3a179087dfbd09119f9106f396335361fba03c07db0--\\r\\n\") => <nil> 655.825247ms" pid=28189
